      "title": "Align the taskbar to the left",
      "description": "Moves the Start button and taskbar icons to the left edge instead of the centre.",
      "rationale": "Restores the pre-Windows 11 muscle memory of a fixed bottom-left Start button; purely cosmetic and instantly reversible.",
