      "id": "shell.taskbar.disable-chat-button",
      "title": "Hide the Chat (Microsoft Teams) taskbar button",
      "description": "Removes the consumer Teams Chat button from the taskbar on Windows 11 22H2.",
      "rationale": "Frees taskbar space for users who do not use consumer Teams; the toggle only applies to 22H2, as the button was removed outright in 23H2 (KB5031455+).",
